## Input

```css
$malformed: 10 % +;
.after-modulo { width: 75%; }

.incomplete {
  @include width-in(75, %;
  color: red;
}
.after-include { color: blue; }

.missing-separator {
  width: if(sass(true): 10 % else: 2px);
  color: red;
}
.after-if { width: 75%; }

